# Text is checked out with LF on every platform, not just stored with it.
#
# A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts text to CRLF, and several
# tests compare a checked-in file byte for byte (cmd/prefixstats reproduces
# data/prefix_stats.json and compares) -- they failed on Windows for line
# endings alone. gofmt also wants LF. The repository already stores LF, so this
# changes no stored content.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pyc binary
